      86.81,
      105.5,
      287.6,
      118.97
    ],
    "text": "An Act to Repeal the Rent Act, No. 7 of 1972",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      130.5,
      309.71,
      156.47
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      167.84,
      309.71,
      231.47
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Rent (Repeal) Act, No. of 2026 and shall come into operation on the date on which the certificate is endorsed in respect of this Act in terms of Article 79 of the Constitution (in this Act referred to as the \u201crelevant date\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      242.84,
      283.64,
      256.68
    ],
    "text": "2. The Rent Act, No. 7 of 1972 is hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      280.34,
      309.71,
      318.97
    ],
    "text": "3. Notwithstanding the repeal of the Rent Act, No. 7 of 1972 (in this section referred to as the \u201crepealed Act\u201d) by section 2 of this Act-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      330.5,
      309.71,
      393.97
    ],
    "text": "(a) no action shall be instituted for the ejectment of a tenant who is in possession of any premises governed by the provisions of the repealed Act on the day immediately preceding the relevant date, for a period of one year from the relevant date;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      405.5,
      309.7,
      481.47
    ],
    "text": "(b) no landlord of any premises governed by the provisions of the repealed Act on the day immediately preceding the relevant date, shall demand or receive any rent in excess of the authorised rent payable under the repealed Act, for a period of one year from the relevant date;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      493.0,
      309.73,
      543.97
    ],
    "text": "(c) any act or thing done or omitted to be done or any right or entitlement acquired under the repealed Act shall be deemed to be valid for a period of one year from the relevant date;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      51.86,
      193.29,
      56.86,
      206.76
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
